{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Gears and use your Fabricator to make drones, turrets, seeker mines and other useful stuff. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Find boxes with military Robots that can help you fight aliens along your way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy weird alien plants to clear weird dark energy field. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available weapons: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Burst Gun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Automatic rifle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Foam gun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricator: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attack Drone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Turret. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seeker mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Static mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Stunner. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3138020?t=1763374036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/bbddd7354c309d67586fc2177f01f28f42d83dc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763374036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/4c98644c497d6d2e218b35de6e8ff83ee1c3fb98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763374036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/4c98644c497d6d2e218b35de6e8ff83ee1c3fb98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763374036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3297890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Collect Gears and use your Fabricator to make drones, turrets, seeker mines and other useful stuff. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Find boxes with military Robots that can help you fight aliens along your way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destroy weird alien plants to clear weird dark energy field. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available weapons: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Burst Gun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Automatic rifle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Foam gun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricator: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attack Drone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Turret. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seeker mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Static mine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Stunner. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Fetysenko Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/4ab13655c63b8348ef828447aca9e866ae88adc9/header.jpg?t=1763374036","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3138020/935005841/16e23b9e2b